flowchart TD
    A[UNTRUSTED SOURCE] --> B[SourcePack + fingerprint]
    B --> C[Normalized claims]
    C --> D[ICP / driver / angle / hook]
    D --> E[Semantic beat graph]
    E --> F[Display + TTS scripts]
    F --> G[Provenance chain root]
    G --> H[Preflight + TTS + claim gates]
    H --> I[Manifest seal + replay fingerprint]
    I --> J{Explicit render authorization?}
    J -- no --> K[Dry-run package]
    J -- yes --> L[Spend / concurrency gate]
    L --> M[Deterministic render_intent_id]
    M --> N[Acquire authority lease]
    N --> O[Fencing token]
    O --> P[Transactional RenderStateStore]
    P --> Q[Provider submit]
    Q --> R{Provider response}
    R -- accepted --> S[ACK/RUNNING state]
    R -- ambiguous --> T[RECONCILE_REQUIRED]
    R -- failed before accept --> U[FAILED_RETRYABLE]
    T --> V[Provider reconciliation]
    V --> P
    S --> W[Validated telemetry]
    W --> X[COMPLETED]
    X --> Y[Downstream handoff]
    Y --> Z[Verify provenance_root + replay_fingerprint]
    Z --> AA[Motion / edit graph]

    AB[Worker A] --> N
    AC[Worker B] --> N
    N -->|lease turnover increments token| O
    O -->|stale token rejected| AD[Stale writer blocked]

    AE[Fuzz corpus] --> H
    AE --> W
    AF[CI / multiprocess tests] --> P
    AF --> H
